---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Andy Sun — student, debater, and builder.">
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:8px">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Andy Sun.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a student, Public Forum debater, and builder. I like making things across
      the stack — from hardware and IoT (an ESP32 fire-safety mask at an MIT hackathon)
      to real-time 3D in the browser with Three.js, to the club and web-design sites
      I've been building since 8th grade.
    </p>

    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <p>
      Most of what I make ends up on
      <a href="https://github.com/andyDgreat12345" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
      This site is my running record of the projects and the things I'm proud of.
    </p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Email me at <a href="mailto:ryanasdspi@gmail.com">ryanasdspi@gmail.com</a>.
      <!-- LinkedIn: add a line here once you share your profile URL -->
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
